---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="Veterinary Teaching Clinic" 
  subtitle="Comprehensive care for livestock and domestic animals."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_4855.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Campus', href: '/campus' },
    { label: 'Veterinary Clinic', href: '/campus/vet-clinic' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={styles.contentWrapper}>
    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Clinical Services</h2>
    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      The FUAZ Veterinary Teaching Clinic serves dual functions: it is the primary clinical training facility for our veterinary students, and it operates as a fully functional animal hospital open to the public and surrounding agricultural communities.
    </p>

    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Facilities & Capabilities</h2>
    <ul class={styles.list}>
      <li><strong>Surgical Theatres:</strong> Equipped for both major soft-tissue and orthopedic procedures on large livestock.</li>
      <li><strong>Diagnostic Pathology:</strong> Advanced laboratories for swift blood work, disease screening, and tissue analysis.</li>
      <li><strong>Equine & Bovine Stalls:</strong> Intensive care and recovery enclosures for horses, cattle, and sheep.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class={styles.importantBox}>
      <strong>Emergency Services:</strong> The clinic operates a 24/7 emergency response unit. Pastoral farmers within Kebbi state requiring urgent field-surgical intervention can call the emergency hotline directly.
    </div>
  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>
